{"version":1,"content":"<p>針對英偉達CEO黃仁勳近期爆出的婚外情風波，美國總統特朗普又一次在公開場合主動發聲談及相關事件。當地時間11月9日，特朗普在白宮召開的例行記者會上公開回應黃仁勳出軌事件，<strong>稱自己剛聽到相關消息的時候也非常驚訝，黃仁勳在他印象裏一直是個人素質極高的行業領袖，完全能想像到對方現在正承受着極大的精神壓力。</strong></p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585744.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.117811+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":155,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T06:38:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_hash":"b710c4c3b54ff3d06f77ec2d460fc636596a9d6dff47d3603fa98d3537692de6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}